1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,210
THE CUSTOMER: Is my latte ready?

2
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:02,560
You are a barista.

3
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,050
THE REGULAR: Name’s Siobhan.

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,850
YOU: Latte for… Bird? Eye?

5
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:10,750
YOU: Oat! Soy! Almond! Next!

6
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:14,360
THE CUSTOMER: Oat latte. Half-caf. Extra hot.

7
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,250
THE CUSTOMER: No foam. Extra foam.

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,960
YOU: One oat latte! Extra foam!

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,110
THE CUSTOMER: Too foamy.

10
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:27,500
THE MANAGER: Why is my café a bubble bath?

11
00:00:30,550 --> 00:00:34,210
THE MANAGER: Sold out! Tomorrow: IT help desk.

12
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:34,950
THE CUSTOMER: Same again!

